OL,3,GNEWSALaura Anne Jones is Reform's new
OL,4,Adeputy Welsh leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Anne Jones is Reform's new deputy
OL,7,Fleader in Wales, the party has
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FThe post was vacated after the previous
OL,11,Fdeputy Helen Jenner took the party's
OL,12,FSenedd leadership on Tuesday.
OL,14,FIt is unclear if anyone stood against
OL,15,Fher. Reform has said there was an
OL,16,Felection, but has not announced any
OL,17,Frivals and has denied she was
OL,18,Fappointed.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
